    "updated_at": "2022-12-25T09:21:48Z",
    "body": "I can't give you the all `.git` folder since this repository is from a professional project. At least, I could test the patched Starship to make sure that it handles properly this issue.\r\n\r\nIn the meantime, I will provide you steps to reproduce from using gitoxide project. I think I might know how to reproduce this issue easily.  ",
