    "created_at": "2022-12-26T06:50:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-26T06:50:32Z",
    "body": "Thanks a lot for the reproduction! It worked, and here is the output in the terminal before and after the fixed `starship` was in the `PATH`.\r\n\r\n```\r\ngitoxide () (REBASING 1/1)\r\n❯ touch .git/objects/11/30e32b27562118356c82a1570fb4fc9766bbcd\r\nthread '<unnamed>' panicked at 'assertion failed: `(left != right)`\r\n  left: `BufError`,\r\n right: `BufError`: Buffer errors might mean we encountered huge headers', /Users/byron/.cargo/registry/src/github.com-1ecc6299db9ec823/git-odb-0.36.0/src/store_impls/loose/find.rs:156:9\r\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\r\n\r\nthread '<unnamed>' panicked at 'assertion failed: `(left != right)`\r\n  left: `BufError`,\r\n right: `BufError`: Buffer errors might mean we encountered huge headers', /Users/byron/.cargo/registry/src/github.com-1ecc6299db9ec823/git-odb-0.36.0/src/store_impls/loose/find.rs:156:9\r\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\r\n\r\nthread '<unnamed>' panicked at 'assertion failed: `(left != right)`\r\n  left: `BufError`,\r\n right: `BufError`: Buffer errors might mean we encountered huge headers', /Users/byron/.cargo/registry/src/github.com-1ecc6299db9ec823/git-odb-0.36.0/src/store_impls/loose/find.rs:156:9\r\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\r\n\r\n\r\ngitoxide () (REBASING 1/1)\r\n❯\r\n```\r\n\r\nWe see that the fix works as intended.\r\nSince it's as easy to reproduce as to try to decode an empty file, I have added another test to assure we don't regress.\r\n\r\nFinally, a [new patch release of `git-repository`](https://github.com/Byron/gitoxide/releases/tag/git-repository-v0.30.2) was created so `starship` can easily be rebuilt to incorporate the fix.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
