    "body": "Thanks a lot @Byron for your responsiveness! It's nice to see this issue resolved so quickly in gitoxide.\r\n\r\nThis bug should rarely appear in practice, but at least, those asserts are now removed!\r\n\r\nPS: It is unclear to me why my .git folder was messed-up a few days ago, it was the first time :sob:. Who knows :laughing:  ",
